# Ta D2_LJ + DM_REAM fixture for the EAM-collapse certificate tests.
# phi: the LJ pair term of ta_lj_cutdummy.tadah (the Tadah! 1.6.0 quickstart
# potential), its WATOM 73 folded into the two LJ weights (WATOM is 1 here so
# the REAM density is not rescaled).
# rho/F: DM_REAM Blip (basis 0) with the grids of MODELS/tests/test_dm_ream.cpp;
# the last five weights are the embedding coefficients. RHOFORM SIGNED:
# the density of every tadah before 1.6.0 (every amplitude is > 0 here).
ATOM              Ta
AMPGRIDMB         0.40 0.25 0.12 0.05
BIAS              false
CEMBFUNC          0.0 0.4 0.8 1.2 1.6
CGRIDMB           1.0 2.0 3.0 4.0
DIMER             false 0 false
INIT2B            true
INITMB            true
LAMBDA            0
MODEL             M_BLR BF_Linear
NORM              false
RCTYPE2B          Cut_Dummy
RCTYPEMB          Cut_Cos
RCUT2B            6.5
RCUTMB            6.0
RHOFORM           SIGNED
SEMBFUNC          1.5 1.5 1.5 1.5 1.5
SGRIDMB           1.0 1.0 1.0 1.0
TYPE2B            D2_LJ Ta Ta
TYPEMB            DM_REAM 0 4 4 4 5 5 0 0 Ta Ta
WATOM             1
WEIGHTS           1036.907574500269861425 190120.978458956589292954 -1.2 -0.9 -0.6 -0.3 0.1
